{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id102023744"}, "name":{"label":"Dermamorphic"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-09T21:52:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13615879440"}, "title":{"label":"Farewell CARROT"}, "content":{"label":"Here we are. The end of the road. Like our government this app has slid into bloated garbage. I would like to explain all the reasons I’m deleting my server content and all carrot apps, but what’s the point? The app no longer resembles what made it useful and entertaining. It’s obvious the developers could care less. \n\nMy rating has steadily declined the past year since installing 9 years ago. Every update places long time options behind paywalls. New options don’t fit the spirit of the Carrot that so many fell in love with. My last update declared I wasn’t ready to uninstall, but now… I’m hoping that when a new update drops that early adopters are appreciated. \n\nHowever, as I stated in previous rating; You can never get yesterday back.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
